# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# A real OpenAI project key (sk-proj-, 164 chars) was committed to .env in the
# repo's FIRST commit, dc29b764 "prva verzija agenta", 2026-03-29 13:03, and
# removed 17 minutes later. The blob remains reachable in history, and this
# repository is PUBLIC — so it has been publicly fetchable since then.
#
# The key is NOT the one currently in .env (different sha256), so it was
# replaced at some point. That is not the same as REVOKED: an unused key that
# was never revoked still works and still bills.
#
# secret-scan therefore stays RED, on purpose, for exactly this one finding.
# Silencing it before revocation is confirmed would be suppressing a live
# credential to make a dashboard green.
#
# TO CLEAR, after revoking the key at platform.openai.com, uncomment the line
# below and record the revocation date in the comment:
#
# revoked YYYY-MM-DD at platform.openai.com; blob remains in history and cannot
# be removed without a history rewrite, which does not substitute for revocation
# because the blob may already be mirrored or cached.
